    {
      "id": "claim_2165952eb89a460f94a00c83b0d13104",
      "statement": "blueprintId is the install key: reimporting the same id updates in place, while changing it after a deployment installed the blueprint promotes a second format and orphans the old one — so a deployed blueprintId must never be edited.",
      "evidence": [
