    {
      "id": "claim_e9858ac56fcf4bb6978260b5152c3737",
      "statement": "The generator validates sidecars at build time (unknown keys rejected, blueprintId restricted to [a-zA-Z0-9._-] and screened against the reserved .featured/.adminConfig keys, positive-integer revision, required output with a known icon) so typos fail the build instead of mis-presenting in production.",
