      "id": "claim_90ca0d9db0544408b13dcfc5027684f0",
      "statement": "FORMAT_BLUEPRINTS_DIR points the generator at an external blueprint directory whose contents replace (not extend) the shipped set, and the build:format-blueprints task is cache: false because cached vp runs strip undeclared env vars and env declarations fingerprint the variable's value rather than the directory contents it names.",
