      "id": "claim_f20aae23ffc942728d049558048c789d",
      "statement": "Bundled formats are installed by the first /api request an isolate handles (fire-and-forget, retried on partial failure), and promotion into AdminConfig.formats is tracked separately from the install stamp.",
